Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:06.37,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,What are these lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:09.54,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,What could these lights that shine brightly at times be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.87,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,It seems like you can touch them and yet cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:16.83,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,So could these lights be shadows of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:20.75,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,If they are shadows, their bodies must exist somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:27.55,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Could things that exist somewhere else in some other world be creating these lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:30.14,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:35.73,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:46.99,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.71,0:01:05.22,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,See, this is how you play with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.39,0:01:14.73,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It's fun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:19.06,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Toys meant to be played by two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.73,0:01:25.07,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Before I came here, she couldn't do this even if she wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:31.66,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,I wonder what she always did when she was alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.87,0:01:36.58,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,...when she was alone in this sad world...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:41.09,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,If only I could shed tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:48.47,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I guess winter exists even in a world like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:54.60,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Does this sky lead to another world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.47,0:02:02.86,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Would that world, perhaps, be where I came from? The warm and lively world?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:27.63,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf24}ki{\kf23}mi {\kf20}da{\kf22}ke {\kf33}ga {\kf32}su{\kf19}gi{\kf27}sa{\kf19}t{\kf39}ta {\kf48}sa{\kf43}ka {\kf42}no {\kf39}to{\kf24}chu{\kf29}u {\kf75}wa
