Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:33.11,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:45.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's Misae-san's kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.88,0:03:47.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:55.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Isn't your master getting better with her moves?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:03:59.85,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You'll never do something like that again, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:02.31,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I won't... I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.85,0:04:04.69,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:07.27,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,If it isn't Furukawa-san and her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:08.52,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You were here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.57,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Good evening, Misae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:14.57,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:14.57,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}The Season You Were There
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.57,0:04:16.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Be gentler with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.41,0:04:18.83,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're overreacting; it's just a little bruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:24.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, we brought some leftover dishes for Sunohara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:28.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mom packed them thinking you were lonely with Mei-chan gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.13,0:04:29.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Seriously? Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.55,0:04:35.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I told you. No one gets lonely at this dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:38.18,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're right. It's too lively if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:40.64,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I'll bring some tea out, so sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:42.39,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,My appreciation for protecting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:44.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Protecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:47.40,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,That jerk tried to sell the cat off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:51.48,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I thought I could make a quick buck if I took it to a pet shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:53.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:55.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What's the name of this kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:56.91,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Nanashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:58.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Nanashi-chan, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:01.91,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Can I call you Nana-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:05.33,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: Nanashi means "Nameless"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:05.33,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,No, not Nanashi-chan. I just haven't named him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.46,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,And that's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:09.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,He's nameless?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:12.63,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But isn't he your cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:19.14,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I never wanted it, but starting some time ago, it began to stay around me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:20.93,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,so I'm just taking care of it because of how things turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:23.47,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Then what's the big deal if I sell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:25.31,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Or maybe stew him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:29.48,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Stew what up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:31.36,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Joking! Just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:36.11,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,He's been attached to you for a while, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:36.95,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.91,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Do your clothes smell like catnip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:41.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:43.95,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:45.12,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:47.83,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,What is everyone doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:51.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is rare. Tomoyo, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:53.38,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's not that rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.38,0:05:55.51,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Sakagami-san comes to visit often.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:59.22,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I come to get advice as the Student Council President.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:04.06,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,This is a perfect opportunity since this involves both Okazaki and Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:08.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Eliminate all tardiness and absence from school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:09.06,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:12.56,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Misae-san was the first female\NStudent Council President in our school's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:17.57,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,And she accomplished the legendary Week of No Tardiness and Absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:19.36,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,That sure brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:23.20,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I want to know how you united the entire school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:25.62,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I want to make it happen, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:31.50,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It'd be really difficult, since there are two who are the biggest obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:33.25,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Who could she be talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:38.76,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun's up early and going to school on time with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:41.68,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Then that leaves Sunohara as the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:43.76,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Should I come to your room to wake you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:45.76,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I wish you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:48.35,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:50.73,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I really didn't do anything special.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.73,0:06:56.53,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I simply said at the morning assembly to try not to be late or absent for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:59.44,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Then everyone went along with it for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:00.99,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,That's all you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:05.70,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,If I could say one thing, I guess not trying too hard only helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:07.79,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I don't really understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:11.83,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,If you get all worked up yourself,\Nyou'll always get someone who'll rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:14.04,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Being too eager brings negative results.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:17.30,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I see. That's a great point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:20.97,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I'm getting quite a few guests today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:22.05,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:23.43,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.43,0:07:27.81,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Don't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:28.97,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.97,0:07:31.48,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Um, about what I asked the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:32.98,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Ah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:35.98,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}Sign: Hikarizaka Shrine Autumn Festival - 9/23 10pm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:34.69,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:38.28,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,An Autumn Fest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:39.19,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.19,0:07:43.61,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's a festival that's been around for a while that wishes for peace and happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.61,0:07:45.91,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I think it's a good choice for your first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:47.62,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I-I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:48.91,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Misae-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:50.83,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:53.58,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,He was asking for advice for where to go on his date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:56.63,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Stop it already. You shouldn't be eavesdropping like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.63,0:07:59.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She's right. Everyone needs privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.34,Default-alt,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't be such killjoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:02.22,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.22,0:08:03.63,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:10.52,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:14.44,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san was eavesdropping on the date plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:18.06,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Divine retribution!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:24.82,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Misae-san, you're being relied on by many students.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:27.95,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,How admirable. I would like to become like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:32.04,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I've been that kind of person for a long time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.45,0:08:33.21,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:35.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It means you're charismatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:38.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There are a lot of guys who are fans of yours in my class, too. {ep 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.09,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's great that I'm liked, {ep 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:44.93,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,but I don't know what they see in a woman who only yells. {ep 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.68,0:08:50.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't just yell. You worry about others, which is the good part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.97,0:08:57.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And, this is something someone on the\Nrugby club said, you have a good smell of soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:02.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,In this dirty boy's dorm,\Nyou've become an idol-like figure. {ep 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Like a jewel in a dunghill. {ep 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:10.24,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yell... and worry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.49,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,And a good smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.21,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:19.00,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's just that someone said\Na similar thing to me in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:20.79,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I was just remembering that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.75,0:09:24.21,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Thank you for your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:25.17,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Sorry I bothered you at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:28.01,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's fine. Come anytime you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:29.43,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I will visit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:36.14,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Sunohara, you go back to your room, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:37.23,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.23,0:09:39.23,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,There's still time before lights-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:42.19,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I've got something to talk about with these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:42.94,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're unwanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:45.94,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Can you be more direct than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.45,0:09:49.86,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)}Sign: Hikarizaka Shrine Autumn Festival - 9/23 10pm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:49.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Go to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:55.66,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yup. Sunohara was saying that you rarely take Furukawa-san out on dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.29,0:09:58.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's our problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.42,0:10:02.54,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,If you're saying something like that,\Nsome other guy will snatch Furukawa-san away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:04.42,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Th-That won't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:06.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I won't be snatched away by anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.51,0:10:15.43,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Look. You won't find another girl who would say something like that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:18.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why are you bringing up something like this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:22.77,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Looking at you two reminded me of my wonderful youthful days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:26.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're still young, Misae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.53,0:10:27.86,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:30.74,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,But I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:36.04,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Right now, my role is to take care of you younglings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:39.41,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:42.17,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Hang around a bit more, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:44.04,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I'll make another pot of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:52.30,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What was this school like when you were the president?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:54.14,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:55.26,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It was an ordinary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:58.27,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sure you had lots of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.27,0:11:02.69,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yeah. It was lively every day, keeping me entertained.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:04.86,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Getting hurt... Getting worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:07.40,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,But I'm still...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:10.61,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:13.24,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,This charm has a light in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:17.24,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It's a light that grants any one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:22.17,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You will take this and go to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:26.25,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,And you will grant her wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.21,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:51.32,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Sign: Hikarizaka Private High School
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:05.33,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Igarashi-kun! Are you on your way home now, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:07.09,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Yeah. You, too, Sagara?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.09,0:12:09.09,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Yeah, what a coincidence. {ep 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.42,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,You know, if you don't mind-{ep 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:12.47,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Who's he? {ep 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.17,0:12:15.05,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Looks like he's from a different school. {ep 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:17.64,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Is he your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:22.10,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,I guess I shouldn't intrude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:23.14,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:25.90,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Ah, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:30.28,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Um, you're Sagara Misae-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:31.99,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:33.45,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm Shima Katsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.11,0:12:35.57,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Don't I look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:42.04,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:43.50,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:47.17,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I don't know you, nor do I see a reason for you to pay me back at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:49.92,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Maybe you don't, but I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:54.01,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Maybe you do, but I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:59.47,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Besides, because of you, he misunderstood! {ep 4}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:03.77,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I've had enough. I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.77,0:13:05.10,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:07.31,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Tell me your wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:08.69,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.69,0:13:11.73,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I came to grant your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.73,0:13:14.15,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,So I can't go home until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:16.36,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Then stop standing in front of me right this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.45,0:13:18.70,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:22.29,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,If... If that really is what you wish for, then I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:25.08,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,But that won't really satisfy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:29.04,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Since you took such good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:35.09,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It was back when I was in elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:40.93,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I think you were going to\Nthe hospital to visit your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:46.10,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,When you went, you cheered me up when you found me in the hospital's courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.73,0:13:48.19,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You don't remember this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.69,0:13:51.65,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I was in a wheelchair with a cat on my lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:54.48,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:55.19,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:57.95,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,But I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:13:59.86,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,We only spoke for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:01.41,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.41,0:14:04.62,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You really cheered me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:07.00,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What exactly did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:09.04,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:11.54,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:14.05,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,But I really am grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:16.01,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That's why I want to return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:18.59,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Then treat me to a can of juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:21.01,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,That's more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.39,0:14:24.93,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Since I really didn't do anything so meaningful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:29.73,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Listen. I can grant any wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:32.90,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I have something that allows that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:37.07,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,So don't hesitate and say something you really wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:40.28,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What is that? Something like a genie's lamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:43.28,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Not a lamp, but that's what I was told.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:44.03,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,By who?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:46.37,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:48.20,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:51.88,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're a real strange one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.13,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:54.84,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,And a romantic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:58.55,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I don't believe in those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:14:59.67,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:02.93,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming all the way to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.34,0:15:05.26,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's great to see that you've recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:06.64,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Bye. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:10.89,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.73,0:15:13.52,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Misae, who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:14.98,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,He's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:17.15,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Did you switch from Igarashi-kun to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:17.61,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Do...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:20.99,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Don't wait in front of the school gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:22.66,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You're... You're hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.66,0:15:25.78,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You made Saki and Yuki misunderstand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.78,0:15:27.58,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What are you going to do if a rumor starts?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.91,0:15:29.33,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Misunderstand what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:32.71,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Look. You're a boy and I'm a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.71,0:15:33.92,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Don't you have any imagination?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:38.55,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Ah, I got it. You like Igarashi-kun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:41.47,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Aren't you really direct?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.47,0:15:44.05,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You're really beautiful, so I'm sure it'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:46.43,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! Let's ask him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:47.93,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'll come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:49.56,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.35,0:15:54.27,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Why must I ask him out with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:56.90,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Th-That hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:16:00.28,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Hey! You came to grant my wish, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:02.15,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,So why are you getting in my way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:05.91,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Then can the wish be to get married to Igarashi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.74,0:16:08.16,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:11.41,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:12.54,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:15.42,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You can't manipulate other people's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:20.88,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.55,0:16:24.22,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,You didn't have to do that all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:26.34,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I told you not to wait at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:29.68,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You're really being bothered by him, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:31.18,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Shima-kun, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:33.89,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You see, Misae has someone she likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.44,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,If Igarashi-kun sees this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:37.40,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:40.98,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Sagara's boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.98,0:16:42.69,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Introduce me, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.69,0:16:45.53,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,N-No! He isn't! He's nothing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:50.91,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I hope he really got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.29,0:16:56.42,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'm sure Igarashi-kun will come to like you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:17:00.55,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.55,0:17:01.55,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.01,0:17:07.18,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You don't get jealous or annoyed even if I like another boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:08.72,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:13.10,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I think I'm just slow at those kinds of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:19.06,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I don't dislike those kinds of things about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:22.94,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's nice how pure you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:41.59,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Do you want to catch a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.00,0:17:46.09,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Why don't you at least have an umbrella with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:48.72,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I didn't think it would start raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.09,0:17:53.14,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Why am I taking care of someone like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.14,0:17:54.06,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:58.35,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,If you're going to apologize,\Nthen don't make me take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.77,0:18:01.65,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Here. I borrowed a jersey for you, so change into these.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:02.11,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.40,0:18:05.44,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:09.49,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,If you can grant anything,\Ncouldn't you have stopped the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.49,0:18:11.12,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:14.95,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I can only grant one wish, and it's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.20,0:18:19.37,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I don't understand why you're so grateful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:21.71,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You don't even remember what I said to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.71,0:18:26.38,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,It's probably the more fact that you\Ntalked to me than what you said to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:28.51,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Since you're very optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:30.97,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I hear that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:35.22,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I think I was able to try because I met someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:37.98,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,So it is all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:45.40,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's time for class, so I've got to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:47.69,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Sneak out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.69,0:18:48.36,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:18:58.91,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Sagara's boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:01.42,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Waiting for her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.42,0:19:04.92,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Um, I'm not Sagara-san's boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:05.96,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,You aren't?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:09.92,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,No. Apparently she already has someone she likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:15.68,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,Hey, can you do a favor for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.31,0:19:25.48,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You look so gloomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.19,0:19:28.73,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Did you really catch a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:31.86,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Then what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:32.95,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Is something troubling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:36.66,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,I know how Sagara feels about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:39.62,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,But as you see, I already have a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:42.96,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,So can you drop a hint to her about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:46.25,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You're too nice to everyone, Igarashi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.25,0:19:48.42,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,What can I do? It's how I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.17,0:19:52.30,Default,Iga,0,0,0,,So please. While hurting her as little as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.59,0:19:55.80,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.80,0:19:57.72,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Talk to your big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:01.35,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Could you possibly be in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.27,0:20:03.81,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.69,0:20:05.44,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:08.11,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I pulled that one out of thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.65,0:20:12.03,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Then why do you look so depressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.45,0:20:18.66,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That's because I have sad news for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.16,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:24.00,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,She has another boy she likes...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:28.42,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,...but that other boy already has a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:32.05,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I was asked by him to pass that on to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:34.63,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Sounds like a drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:37.05,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,But that's a chance for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:45.31,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,{\fs72.9}If you comfort her when she's depressed from the shock of a broken heart, she might come to like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.73,0:20:47.56,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Come on, Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:49.90,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Stop being depressed and think positively.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:50.98,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.44,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,This is a great chance for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:54.07,Default-alt,Shi,0,0,0,,I can't possibly think like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.16,0:20:59.62,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,If you were in my shoes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.33,0:21:02.62,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,...could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:03.66,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Could you think like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.12,0:21:06.04,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,When you like that person so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.21,0:21:11.50,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,Could you think of it as an opportunity when the person is broken-hearted?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:14.01,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:19.97,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Girls around me all think positively like that, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:41.45,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Shima-kun... What you said just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.04,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.83,0:21:47.16,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I'm such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:53.30,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Why are you the one crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:54.84,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:09.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:26.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.29,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:33.29,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:41.34,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:41.34,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.34,0:22:48.43,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.34,0:22:48.43,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.43,0:22:55.73,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.43,0:22:55.73,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:23:04.37,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:23:04.37,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:11.96,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:19.51,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small silhouette leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.51,0:23:27.06,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.56,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:34.56,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:39.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:39.82,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:43.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.57,0:23:49.37,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,That was the name of the person dearest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.58,0:24:01.30,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,We spent much time together,\Nand he left me with his last wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.09,0:24:07.18,Default,Shi,0,0,0,,I came to grant that wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 6
